lemma bodyCert(w:U∈pureHeart): ∃ B:ℝ,0≤B∧∀ (q:Cover)(p:ResidualPermit q)(i:Axis)(x:P.Spectrum0 i)(l r:ℝ),4*moonClock P s≤ l→ 4*moonClock P s≤ r→∀ v:ℕ,s<v→
 ‖tideX P η q p M i x pT e K U l r-(arcYear P η M W pT e K C₁ U w v) • (rawPSE P M i x p W.tally l r)‖≤ B*((P.macroStep v)^(7/8:ℝ)):=by
 obtain ⟨C,h,u⟩:= primaryRise P η M U W ht7 pT e K C₁ w; obtain ⟨F,p,h1⟩:= paidTide P η M W ht7 pT e K T₁ H' a₀ x₁ J Lh R
 let pF:=F*‖U‖ + C/2; refine ⟨pF,(by unfold pF; positivity),fun q p i x l r hl hr v p₁=>?_⟩
 let A':= arcYear P η M W pT e K C₁ U w v; let Y:= rawPSE P M i x p W.tally l r; let X:=incomeX P η q p M i x pT e K U v l r; let d:=clockP P s; let hp:= h1 l r hl hr v p₁ q p i x U; let K₁:= ((P.macroStep v)^(7/8:ℝ)); have Yp:= u q p i x v p₁ _ _ (by linarith only [hl,d] :2 * moonClock P s ≤ l) (by linarith only [hr,d] :2 * moonClock P s≤ r)
 have H₁:‖X-A' • Y‖ ≤ (C/2)*K₁:= shrinkP P (P.ColorHil i x) _ (A' • Y) C (by rw [show epsiK P v • (A' • Y)= (scriptQ P η M W pT e K C₁ v U w) • Y from bootYear ..]; exact Yp)
 refine (norm_sub_le_norm_sub_add_norm_sub _ X _).trans ?_; rw [norm_sub_rev _ X]; refine le_trans (add_le_add hp H₁) (le_of_eq ?_); unfold pF K₁; ring
